MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- the wire scripts' tag maps (94 rows): 'machine.state': ['palMainStatus', 'text']
- panel section 顯示的資料標籤: palMainStatus <- machine.state <-
  WebBridgeTags.cpp:1156 (publishing files first: WebBridge*/wb_serve/JsonBridge)
- CodeLens above a C++ line with a mapped tag literal: 網頁顯示 machine.state：
  main.html › palMainStatus (command compares `== "x.y"` are left to the
  command lens)

Tests: lib 64 / probe 2 pages / fake vscode 40 / real VS Code 40 incl.
8-page sweep -- all pass, 12 opened files byte-identical (MD5).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
